The directory is expected by code in BioBasePydanticModelGenerator 
and generate_omop_pydantic_model_defs.

The subdirectory custom_templates/pydantic_v2 has template(s)
that are used by datamodel-code-generator to generate the Python
code defining Pydantic models, and that package expects the exisiting
directory structure.

The template file(s) in this directory are used to insert additional
text into the models that is not generated by datamodel-code-generator.
